 an intermediate conclusion meant to support another conclusion.  \n- **D** is correct: The first boldface is a **prediction** (middle school results will decline) that, if accurate, directly supports the **main conclusion** (the CEHE ranking will drop further). The second boldface is explicitly the main conclusion.  \n\n**Correct Answer**: D",
