t being near it. So C is incorrect in that wording.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer would be D, because the credit system is presented as a way to address the problem, hence a beneficial attempt. .\n\nYes! That makes sense. The original says the moral system collapses when those acts are exposed, so the collapse is a result. Option C incorrectly states it\'s on the verge, while the context says it does collapse. Therefore, C is wrong. Therefore, my final option is: ']] 26%|##6       | 157/600 [1:01:37<2:58:01, 24.11s/it]
