ellow (A's ball) \u2705.\n- **Clue 2**: A (yellow) and blue (B's ball) have different sizes \u2705.\n- **Clue 3**: Blue (B's) is smaller than C (red) \u2705.\n\n**Option Analysis**:\n- **A**: Incorrect (C has red, not yellow).\n- **B**: Invalid (A cannot have blue).\n- **C**: Invalid (C cannot have blue; blue is with B).\n- **D**: Correct (matches all deductions).\n\n**Answer**:  \n\\boxed{D}",
