lf.  \n- **D** incorrectly elevates the network as an \"important way,\" whereas the passage cautions against it becoming mainstream.  \n\n**Correct Answer:** A) The society ruled by law cannot mainly rely on the network for effective supervision.  \n\nThe main idea is the necessity to avoid making network supervision the primary method and instead focus on strengthening existing legal mechanisms.",
