 main point isn\'t about Italy itself. Body art (C) is part of the description of the artworks, but the conclusion ties it to modern sports. Michelangelo (D) is the artist referenced, but again, the passage\'s focus is on the broader connection to modern sports through his work. .\n\nSo even though body art is part of the context, the passage\'s conclusion specifically mentions the relationship with modern sports. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
