t for other diseases, but the study explicitly states all patients here received the same standard treatment (which presumably excludes support groups). This doesn\u2019t address longevity in the context of disease T and is irrelevant to the death-rate comparison.\n\n**Options B and C** focus on unrelated factors (faith in treatment, coping) or quality of life, which don\u2019t counter the longevity argument.\n\n**Answer: A**",
