correct guess.\n\n   - **Option D:** \n     - Zhao Ming at PKU, Qian Hong at BNU, Sun Jie at THU.\n     - **Classmate A:** Both guesses wrong (Zhao not at THU, Sun not at BNU).\n     - Fails because A must have one correct guess.\n\n3. **Conclusion:**\n   - Only **Option A** satisfies all conditions where each classmate has exactly one correct guess.\n\n### Final Answer:\n\\boxed{A}",
