he class guarantees failure, thereby reinforcing the \"must attend\" requirement.\n\n**Option B** (\"Only those who intend to take the exam attend the class\") focuses on exclusivity rather than necessity. It does not address whether attendance is required for success, only that attendees are exam takers. This does not strengthen the necessity of attending for Xiaozhuang.\n\nThus, **D** is the best choice as it directly establishes the necessity of attending the class to achieve the desired outcome (passing the exam).\n\n**Answer: D**",
